        <p source="#source-1917336-1917476"><seg source="#source-1917336-1917342">一番</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1917342-1917369"><rb>忍法</rb><rt>にんぽう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1917369-1917375">　　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1917375-1917396"><rb>御方</rb><rt>みかた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1917396-1917399">　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1917399-1917432"><rb>隠密組</rb><rt>おんみつぐみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1917432-1917435">　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1917435-1917474"><rb>菊池半助</rb><rt>きくちはんすけ</rt></ruby></p>
