        <p source="#source-1917746-1917889"><seg source="#source-1917746-1917752">三番</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1917752-1917779"><rb>吹針</rb><rt>ふきばり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1917779-1917794">　　御方　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1917794-1917857"><rb>宗門御抱老女</rb><rt>しゅうもんおかかえろうじょ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1917857-1917860">　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1917860-1917887"><rb>修道者</rb><rt>イルマン</rt></ruby></p>
