        <p source="#source-1917945-1918082"><seg source="#source-1917945-1917951">四番</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1917951-1917981"><rb>幻術</rb><rt>げんじゅつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1917981-1917996">　　御方　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1917996-1918032"><rb>南蛮流</rb><rt>なんばんりゅう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1918032-1918035">　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1918035-1918080"><rb>和田呂宋兵衛</rb><rt>わだるそんべえ</rt></ruby></p>
