        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-1918380-1918448"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1918383-1918407"><rb>以上</rb><rt>いじょう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1918407-1918410">五</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1918410-1918434"><rb>試合</rb><rt>しあい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1918434-1918448">のこと。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-1918448-1918708"><seg source="#source-1918448-1918475">右のうち吹針には</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1918475-1918487"><rb>他</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1918487-1918490">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1918490-1918508"><rb>武技</rb><rt>ぶぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1918508-1918541">をもって試合することを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1918541-1918553"><rb>得</rb><rt>う</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1918553-1918589">、また遠駆けには相手方、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1918589-1918613"><rb>騎乗</rb><rt>きじょう</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1918613-1918631"><rb>徒歩</rb><rt>かち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1918631-1918649">いずれにても</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1918649-1918670"><rb>随意</rb><rt>ずいい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1918670-1918688">たるべきもの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1918688-1918703"><rb>也</rb><rt>なり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1918703-1918708">。</seg></p>
